\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the edge of a city\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It takes a long time to drive to work from the outskirts of town.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"inner city\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the center of a city\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The inner city can be dangerous.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"industrial zone\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"where companies make products\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">There are no houses in the industrial zone.</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": " ", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Quantifiers", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use a quantifier before a noun to indicate the amount or number of an item.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":9,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Quantifier\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"more\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a larger number/amount\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"less/fewer\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a smaller number/amount\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"no/none\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"zero\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"any /not any\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ask about a number or amount/say there is no\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"some\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a small number/amount\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a lot of / lots of\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a very large number/amount\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"plenty of\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"more than you need\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"enough\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"as much as you need\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to bargain", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to expect or plan on something happening", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I didn't bargain for this much excitement.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear in a telephone call to a friend.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "marina", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an area where privately owned boats are kept ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We went shopping down at the marina.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "haunt ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a place that you go to often ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The movie theatre is one of Jason's favorite haunts.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "quirky", "type": "name"}, {"content": "unusual especially in an interesting way", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She loves to wander through quirky shops.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "hipster ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a modern culture that values independent thinking, progressive politics, art and indie-rock, creativity, and  intelligence", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This is a bit of a hipster neighborhood.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Research the neighborhoods in San Francisco.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Decide on the area where you want to live.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a paragraph about the neighborhood. Does it have bookstores? Quirky shops? Nice restaurants?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Include quantifiers like <span class=\"italic\">some</span>, <span class=\"italic\">plenty</span> and <span class=\"italic\">a lot</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your paragraph aloud to a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I research neighborhoods  in San Francisco.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a paragraph on where I want to live.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I include quantifiers in my writing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I proofread my paragraph about a neighborhood.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my paragraph about a neighborhood aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le04ob08re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn5le04ob08re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le04ob08re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hey Sal,  what's been happening? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Not a lot, how's San Francisco?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: It's been pretty eventful, more than I bargained for.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: How?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well, I was in an accident on my way from the airport.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh no. Was it serious? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: No ... but there were some cable cars and angry tourists involved.<br>"}, {"image": "engenn5le04ob08re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "17000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yikes! How's Vanessa?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: She's good. She's going to ask her boss about getting some time off.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I bet she's busy with the new job. Sous-chefs work a lot of hours.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: It's been nice to hang out with her. We went Christmas shopping at the marina a couple days ago.<br>"}, {"image": "engenn5le04ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "32000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I bet she took you to all her favorite haunts. She loves art galleries and quirky shops.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: We spent plenty of time in the Mission neighborhood. It seemed a bit too hipster for me.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh Peter, you're such a fool!<br>"}], "coverimg": "engenn5le04ob08re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "", "id": 1, "time": "1", "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">How do you write about a city?</span>"}, {"image": "", "id": 2, "time": "15000", "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">What are the different parts of a city?</span>"}], "video_src": "engenn5le04ob08re3vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "video",